            "description_html": "<b>MNG 214, Laguna 5 Inch Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Laguna 5 Inch Cabinet Pull is modern and sleek. This easy to care for kitchen cabinet pull has 5 inch mounting centers and measures 5.5 inches overall. The Modern Silver Drawer Pull is available in polished chrome or satin nickel finish. Each of the Laguna 128mm Pulls comes packaged with mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis cabinet pull is part of the <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=MNG+Laguna\">MNG Laguna Collection</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the MNG 214 Laguna 5 Inch Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Base Material: Zinc </li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screws and 1-1/2\"  long #8-32 screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i> \r\n</p>",
